
### GET all items
GET http://localhost:3000/api/items

### GET one item
GET http://localhost:3000/api/items/1

### POST a new item
POST http://localhost:3000/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Eli's New Game",
    "category": "RPG",
    "description": "A new game added through the API.",
    "platform": "PC",
    "rating": 8
}

### PUT update an item
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Final Fantasy VII Rebirth Updated",
    "category": "RPG",
    "description": "Updated through the REST API.",
    "platform": "PS5, PC",
    "rating": 10
}

### DELETE an item
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/items/6
